<section{{#if id}} id="{{id}}"{{/if}} class="info-block{{#if border}} info-block--border{{/if}}{{#if container}} u-container{{/if}}">
  {{#get 'pages' filter=copy limit='1' include='feature_image'}}
    {{#foreach pages}}
      <div class="info-block__content">
        {{content}}
        {{#if ../../primary}}
          {{> "components/cta-buttons" primary=../../primary secondary=../../secondary}}
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      {{#if feature_image}}
        <div class="info-block__image">
          {{> "components/image" src=feature_image alt=custom_excerpt}}
        </div>
      {{/if}}
    {{/foreach}}
  {{/get}}
</section>
